我们的主题曲是《NYC》，由我们自己的乔希·拉格纳创作，特别感谢罗拉·肯尼迪和埃利奥特·康纳德。

01:13:51.420 --> 01:13:57.859
Visit howwemadeyourmother.com to sign up for our substack mailing list and for links to our social media.
访问 howwemadeyourmother.com 以注册我们的 Substack 邮件列表并获取我们社交媒体的链接。

01:13:57.859 --> 01:14:02.819
You can also click on the contact page to send us an email or a voice message.
你也可以点击联系页面向我们发送电子邮件或语音留言。

01:14:02.819 --> 01:14:06.260
Your stories and questions are an important part of the show.
你的故事和问题是本节目的重要组成部分。

01:14:06.260 --> 01:14:19.380
Subscribe to Josh Rader's newsletters on Substack, read Craig Thomas' published prose at CraigThomasRider.com, and you can subscribe to my Dead Father Society, also on Substack.
在 Substack 上订阅乔希·拉德纳的时事通讯，在 CraigThomasRider.com 阅读克雷格·托马斯出版的散文，你也可以订阅我的“已故父亲协会”，同样在 Substack 上。

01:14:19.380 --> 01:14:31.939
To learn about how you make a difference, this shows ongoing campaign to raise money for a congenital heart disease research, check out the Make a Difference tab at the top of our website.
要了解你如何能产生影响，本节目为先天性心脏病研究筹集资金的持续活动，请查看我们网站顶部的“产生影响”标签页。

01:14:31.939 --> 01:14:38.439
This episode was made possible by the support of backyard ventures, marketing provided by Tink Media.
本集的制作离不开 Backyard Ventures 的支持，营销由 Tink Media 提供。

01:14:38.439 --> 01:14:50.930
People will, in fact, dance.
事实上，人们会跳舞的。
